{"id":"625393","name":"香干鸡蛋拌马兰头","author":"elmonte","authorId":"266491","desc":"","cover":"images/625393/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"马兰头","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香干","amount":"2小块"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜头","amount":"4瓣"},{"name":"油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"马兰头摘其嫩芽，洗干净。","img":"images/625393/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"香干切丁。","img":"images/625393/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒜头剁末。","img":"images/625393/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅放水烧开，放少许盐和油，放入马兰头焯一下。","img":"images/625393/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"过一下凉水。","img":"images/625393/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"稍微挤去水份。（不用挤得太干）","img":"images/625393/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"稍切碎。","img":"images/625393/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅放少许油，打入鸡蛋，用铲子或筷子不停搅拌，把鸡蛋炒成碎碎，盛起备用。","img":"images/625393/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅再放少许油，把蒜末爆出香味。","img":"images/625393/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入香干丁炒1-2分钟。","img":"images/625393/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"关火，放入马兰头。","img":"images/625393/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入鸡蛋，蚝油，陈醋，糖和少许盐。","img":"images/625393/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"快速拌匀即可。","img":"images/625393/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"清香小菜。","img":"images/625393/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}